{"code":"318010","name":"팜스빌","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리업체및서비스","sector_desc":"병원·유통·의료 서비스. 의료 정책과 보험 수가 변화의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2000년 건강기능식품업을 영위할 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2019년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 고려대학교 기술지주회사와 '팜스빌 바이오랩' 자회사를 설립하고, 전북기술지주회사와 '헬스코치생명공학' 연구소 기업을 설립하여 운영 중임. 동사는 건강기능식품 제조, 유통 및 판매를 주력 사업으로 영위하며, B2C 전자상거래 플랫폼 및 다양한 유통 플랫폼을 통해 건강기능식품과 건강지향식품을 개발·제조하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":3500.0,"open":3455.0,"high":3505.0,"low":3390.0,"volume":352,"amount":1232000.0,"ret_1d":1.3025,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":3.2857,"ret_5":-0.5682,"ret_20":-5.2774,"ret_60":-5.1491,"ret_120":-5.7873,"ret_250":-6.6667,"ma20":3543.75,"ma60":3617.1667,"ma120":3575.5417,"ma200":3552.675,"close_vs_ma200":-1.4827,"close_vs_ma60":-3.2392,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-7.951,"r2_60":0.0441,"slope_120":5.0185,"r2_120":0.0375,"slope_250":1.6356,"r2_250":0.0186,"high52":4320.0,"low52":3135.0,"pos_52w":30.8017,"dd_52w":-18.9815,"mdd_1y":-17.7606,"atr14_pct":5.2653,"vol_ann_60":35.137,"vol_avg20":2184.05,"vol_ratio20":0.1612,"vr5":0.3909,"vr20":0.2073,"amount_avg5":4566071.0,"amount_avg20":7638517.0,"amount_avg60":10465985.6667,"obv_chg20":-18.0055,"turnover_20":0.5509,"pv_eff_20":-9.58,"rsi14":46.1611,"frgn_net_5":-98.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0012,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0012,"frgn_net_20":-3697.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0466,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0466,"frgn_net_60":-8696.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1097,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1097,"frgn_net_120":-18947.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.2389,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.2389,"foreign_ratio":0.75,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.14,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-2.0,"op_margin_q":-8.3333,"op_qoq":-100.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":33.3333,"rev_yoy":-22.5806,"op_trend_4q":-0.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.53,"debt_ratio":2.49,"per":9.28,"pbr":0.41,"div_yield":5.71,"foreign_rate":0.75,